          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 61.1,
          "end": 63.79,
          "en": "And you will see how to use this context",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 63.79,
          "end": 66.223,
          "en": "in our components in just a second.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 67.13,
          "end": 68.38,
          "en": "And we can therefore also add,",
